{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/74f4a88b2b93e0660f123756311b5f7c.poster.avif?t=1770716614\" width=916 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/74f4a88b2b93e0660f123756311b5f7c.webm?t=1770716614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/74f4a88b2b93e0660f123756311b5f7c.mp4?t=1770716614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VANRAN is a dark fantasy action RPG where a fallen human slave wields a sealed blade to spark rebellion. <br>Players walk a brutal path toward freedom in a world of despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/fb6d75d76a85305cf11fa95975f01c93.poster.avif?t=1770716614\" width=916 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/fb6d75d76a85305cf11fa95975f01c93.webm?t=1770716614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/fb6d75d76a85305cf11fa95975f01c93.mp4?t=1770716614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed chain action movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trap-filled map design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish, fast soulslike combat with parry &amp; dodge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grotesque bosses with unique attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic battles against colossal titans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings shaped by vengeance or salvation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor farming &amp; loot exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-changing dungeons with high-level enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the hidden legacy of the fallen king</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/0512b62c156efd047a1e7eb3195674a2.avif?t=1770716614\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/0aaf0b2e5f2f0b11220e2976458d87d5.avif?t=1770716614\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/1c9814ba495a32243fabb7e545b7f568.avif?t=1770716614\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/1c494d17fa0e762b56fcc6dbaa775e4c.avif?t=1770716614\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/18e17e49d503b85b04b4a27c1c7ff99e.avif?t=1770716614\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449370?t=1770716614","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/2b191b98b8c0d719edd61cf62cac4061158c795b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770716614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/9862fd7826ba767e78ad4f19112a67007dabb758/caps